  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Missing Smallest positive integer\n\nProblem statement \n\nWrite a program for given an unsorted array with both positive and negative elements, You have to find the smallest positive number missing from the array. You can modify the original array\n\nFor Example:\n\nInput:\n\n   {2,3,7,6,8,-1,-10,15}\n\n   The smallest positive & missing integer is 1.",
    "constraints": [
      "nil"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "It contains the size and the elements of the array.",
    "outputFormat": "Print the missing smallest positive integer.",
    "notes": [],
